+     -> `acm.schema.json`; reads and JSON-parses the file from
+     `SCHEMA_DIR`; must raise `KeyError` for any other name; must be
+     wrapped with `functools.lru_cache`.
+   - `class SchemaValidationError(Exception)`: constructor takes a list of
+     error strings, stores it as `self.errors`, and calls
+     `super().__init__("; ".join(errors))`.
+   - `validate_document(name: str, document: dict) -> None`: THE
