+
+2. Create the three JSON Schema files (Draft 2020-12) exactly as described
+   in the specification: correct `$id`, `$schema`, `additionalProperties:
+   false`, all required properties, exact enums (note the `result` enum
+   MUST list the 11 values in the exact order given), exact regex patterns
+   for sha256 hex digests (`^[a-f0-9]{64}$`), exact const values
+   (`schema_id`, `data_residency: "eu-only"`), nested object schemas for
+   `signature`, `budgets`, `change_set_plan` items, and `rollback_contract`
+   with `additionalProperties: false` and correct `required` lists.
+
+3. Rewrite `iadf/schemas/__init__.py` to provide:
