+2. acm.schema.json: fix `status` enum to `["DRAFT","ACTIVATED","REJECTED"]`.
+3. acm.schema.json: fix `data_class` enum to `["PUB","INT","CONF","SRC","SEC"]`.
+4. acm.schema.json: fix `risk_class` enum to `["R0","R1","R2","R3"]`.
+5. acm.schema.json: fix `rollback_contract.type` enum to `["redeploy_previous_digest","expand_contract_migration"]`; add `"minLength":1` to `target`.
+6. acm.schema.json: fix `environments` enum to `["LOCAL-SYNTH","DEV-EU","STAGE-EU","PROD-EU"]` and add `"minItems":1, "uniqueItems":true` on the `environments` array; add `minItems:1` on `path_globs`.
+7. aoe.schema.json: fix `status` enum to `["DRAFT","ACTIVE","EXPIRED","SUPERSEDED"]`.
